# Nothing here is ignored any more, and the reason is worth stating.
#
# labels/ is hand-produced annotation and cannot be regenerated by any script.
# It was ignored by mistake and 38 labels sat untracked.
#
# packets/ is the frozen evidence each label was written against. It is nominally
# reproducible from sample.json plus the repos, but the renderer's truncation caps
# were changed mid-pass and 16 packets changed with them, so "reproducible" is not
# the same as "unchanged". A reviewer auditing a label needs the packet as it was.
#
# sample.json pins the study set. It is derivable from the seed and the benchmark,
# which makes it only as stable as the benchmark, and that has been corrected twice.
